<h1>Back-channel logout</h1>

<p>Try this:</p>
<ol>
    <li>Open <b>Secret</b> and log in.</li>
    <li>Open the <a href="https://localhost:7101" target="_blank">auth server</a> in a new tab and click <b>Log out of all apps</b>.</li>
    <li>Come back here and reload <b>Secret</b>: you have to log in again.</li>
</ol>

<p>
    In step 2 the auth server sends this app a <b>logout token</b> directly, server to server.
    This app never saw the logout happen in the browser - without back-channel logout,
    you would still be logged in here.
</p>
